Package: causalding
Title: Worked Solutions to 'A First Course in Causal Inference'
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Carlos", "Vera-Ciro", , "caverac@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Estimators, simulations and figure data behind the worked
    solutions to the homework problems in Ding (2024) <doi:10.1201/9781003484080>.
    Every exported function validates its arguments, and the package also
    writes the data drawn by the companion documentation site.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/caverac/causal-inference-ding,
    https://caverac.github.io/causal-inference-ding/
BugReports: https://github.com/caverac/causal-inference-ding/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.6.0)
Imports:
    checkmate,
    datasets,
    jsonlite,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
